                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I don't think VR adds anything to this game.  In fact, it's probably better played on a mobile phone.  If this were a .99 cents game, I don't think I would rate negatively.  It's an okay puzzle game with some funny voice one-liners.  There is something funny about seeing an astronaut getting pummeled through puzzle obstacles.  \n\nBut at $14.99 it's just crazy for this type of 'puzzle game' if you can call it that.  It's more like angry birds.  Except the VR adds nothing, except clunky controls.  I got it on sale for $5.09 USD and that's way too much still.\n\nRating 3/10 content does not match price, but it would be a pretty good .99 cents mobile game if it were that",
